  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DANIDA SPA 2023 Top-up Sahel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The protection crisis in the Sahel is rooted in long term grievances of communities, weakened resilience systems due to insecurity and insufficient responses to the change in the ecosystems, fuelled by climate change, conflict, and changes in agro-pastoral practices.The response will strengthen local capacities on disaster preparedness and response, local rapid emergency responses and support locally grounded and climate adapted solutions (micro-projects) to prevent and mitigate negative impact of climate shocks and respond to humanitarian needs with a conflict sensitive approach.</narrative>
  </description>
